From 5d7994d4854646a07cfb5a4f30947eaa4269a6d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 10:52:22 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] PSP port: tick-rate-independent timers (TICKS_FROM_30HZ)

Per-tick constants in the AI and object code expressed through
TICKS_FROM_30HZ(), so the tick rate could be changed for the PSP study.
The PSP build applies its other changes at build time (psp_fixups.py).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: [private link]
